{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71818","main_id":71818,"main_title":"此灯寄何人","main_description":"轻策庄的小白似乎正为某事而做着准备…","chapter_title":"此灯寄何人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7181802,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181802,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":718180203,"next_line_ids":[718180204],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":213701,"speaker_text_hash":1969037909,"speaker":"江城","speaker_raw":"江城","text_hash":1581958986,"text":"嗨，我可还没老糊涂呢…怎么会认不出你…","raw_text":"嗨，我可还没老糊涂呢…怎么会认不出你…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181802.json"}
